1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
The clean room where Roman was built

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,880
at NASA's Goddard Space Flight Center in Maryland

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,960
is the largest clean room of its kind in the world.

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,120
It's massive, eight stories tall,

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,940
with enough floor space to fit two basketball courts.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,520
Inside this room, it is exactly 68 degrees Fahrenheit

7
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:20,100
and exactly 45 percent humidity.

8
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:23,760
There's a carefully calibrated air purifying system

9
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,020
that is constantly circulating clean air.

10
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:29,240
An entire wall of this room is an eight-story grid

11
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,580
of air filters, which can filter out particles

12
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,620
as small as a red blood cell.

